{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "丘墟取跗骨交接缝，为胆经原穴，眼疾可取不分虚实。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb40"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c01", "evidence_quote": "他是元穴", "seg_from": 19, "seg_to": 34, "start_s": 83.47, "end_s": 195.195, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=83s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 83.47, "end_s": 195.19}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "元穴=原穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "踝扭伤可商丘透丘墟：屈踝，自两筋下方穿透，约一寸半针。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp5", "acupoint.gb40"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c01", "evidence_quote": "商丘透丘墟", "seg_from": 23, "seg_to": 28, "start_s": 112.09, "end_s": 161.37, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=112s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 112.09, "end_s": 161.37}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "腰如皮带横圈痛，属带脉样，取足临泣常可即时止痛。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb41"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c02", "evidence_quote": "像皮带一样下灵气", "seg_from": 64, "seg_to": 65, "start_s": 360.55, "end_s": 373.995, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=360s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 360.55, "end_s": 374.0}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "灵气=足临泣", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "足窍阴为胆经井穴、末穴，在第四趾外侧；第五趾外侧为膀胱经至阴，勿混。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb44", "acupoint.bl67"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c03", "evidence_quote": "窍阴穴就是胆经的最后一个穴道", "seg_from": 82, "seg_to": 138, "start_s": 475.91, "end_s": 791.055, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=475s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 475.91, "end_s": 791.05}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "足临泣属木，为胆经本穴；治带脉病、眼科及胆经所过之乳房结块。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb41", "meridian.gb"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c03", "evidence_quote": "灵气呢又是胆经的本血", "seg_from": 87, "seg_to": 94, "start_s": 495.56, "end_s": 541.345, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=495s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 495.56, "end_s": 541.35}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "本血=本穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "胆经子时（23–1时）流注，其后入肝经；胆石症常半夜发作。熟经络与流注利辨证。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.gb", "meridian.lr"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c03", "evidence_quote": "晚上十一点到一点是胆经", "seg_from": 97, "seg_to": 166, "start_s": 551.49, "end_s": 947.16, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=551s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 551.49, "end_s": 947.16}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "地五会昔因动脉少针，今细针可用；常用于乳岩/乳房硬块，因胆经过胸乳。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb42", "meridian.gb"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c03", "evidence_quote": "治疗乳癌的一个乳房硬块", "seg_from": 105, "seg_to": 107, "start_s": 593.98, "end_s": 620.545, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=593s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 593.98, "end_s": 620.54}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "第五会=地五会", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0008", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "侠溪为母穴，虚证取之；偏头痛可刺对侧侠溪。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb43"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c03", "evidence_quote": "侠溪穴是母穴", "seg_from": 117, "seg_to": 132, "start_s": 663.18, "end_s": 751.955, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=663s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 663.18, "end_s": 751.96}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-052.kp0009", "video_id": "zj-052", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "眼外眦痛取窍阴；眼下痛责胃经厉兑，非窍阴/至阴。井穴多用五分针或放血，少灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb44", "acupoint.st45"], "chapter_id": "zj-052.c04", "evidence_quote": "阴穴是井穴", "seg_from": 138, "seg_to": 153, "start_s": 784.58, "end_s": 873.02, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sxeOOuiZJt0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sxeOOuiZJt0&t=784s", "series": "zj", "episode": 52, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 52", "start_s": 784.58, "end_s": 873.02}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
